"""User adjusts / cancel-replaces a bot SL or TP on Lucid → bot keeps tracking.

No live orders: Rithmic is mocked. Covers:
  * same-basket modify (Lucid blanks user_tag, price changes) → price follows
  * cancel/replace → bot adopts the new working leg (never the other trade's)
  * fill of an adjusted / adopted leg is detected → exit recorded, sibling cancelled
  * entry not dropped while only adopted legs protect it (list_positions=0 on sim)
  * early manual close of ONE of two trades frees that slot only
  * start_live_rithmic follows the new prices and frees the slot on close
"""
from __future__ import annotations

